<title>JAPAN: Kawasaki Kinkai - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kawasaki Kinkai - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    12.41		vs	   11.68</p>
<p> Operating	  936    mln	  vs	  877    mln</p>
<p> Current	    765    mln	  vs	  670    mln</p>
<p> Net		  333    mln	  vs	  327    mln</p>
<p> EPS		   11.30 yen	  vs	   11.08 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     30 million	  vs	  30 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kawasaki Kinkai Kisen Kaisha Ltd is an operator of coastal carriers.</p>
</text>
